### 6. XP Can Go Negative Without Floor

**Problem** in [game_bloc.dart:1068](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/presentation/blocs/game/game_bloc.dart#L1068):
```dart
xp -= 20; // On loss
```
Combined with hint penalties (`state.xpGained - hintResult.xpCost`), XP can go arbitrarily negative. No floor/clamp is applied before syncing to the server.

---

### 7. `MultiplayerService.dispose()` Called on Disconnect But Instance is Singleton

**Problem**: `MultiplayerService` is a singleton (`factory MultiplayerService() => _instance`) but `dispose()` closes the stream controllers permanently. After disconnect + reconnect, the broadcast streams are closed and new listeners will fail silently.

